# Wave W17-O (Route 113): sweep sand — the swept pale road: ash-pale sand kept broom-clean by the sweeper’s rounds, its broom streaks drawn as long soft light bands across the tread (design-authorised: the swept pale road running south to Ashfall). The palest road in Maris’s ash country — split from the summit’s smokefloor (unswept ash-sand, grey-flecked) by the streaks: this road is KEPT.
